OL,3,GNEWSAPupils can stay at riverside
OL,4,Aschool farm
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome of Devon's most vulnerable
OL,7,Fchildren have been given the chance to
OL,8,Fkeep learning at a riverside school
OL,9,Ffarm after councillors backed plans to
OL,10,Fcontinue its use despite flood risk
OL,11,Fconcerns.
OL,13,FThe Greater Horseshoe School asked
OL,14,FTeignbridge District Council for
OL,15,Fpermission to carry on using its
OL,16,F40-acre (16-hectare) farm site at
OL,17,FChipley Mill, near Bickington, where
OL,18,Fstudents with complex needs take part
OL,19,Fin activities involving horticulture,
OL,20,Fanimal care and outdoor learning.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,347,340,200,160,0,100
