OL,3,GNEWSAPupils can stay at riverside
OL,4,Aschool farm
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlanners recommended refusing the
OL,7,Fapplication because of flood concerns
OL,8,Fand a lack of information about
OL,9,Fpotential impacts on protected species.
OL,11,FHowever, councillors heard the school
OL,12,Fhad operated there since 2018 without
OL,13,Fincident.
